{
 "_what": "Hero auras. Sources are the owner's hand-picked aura dummies, archived in ServerStorage.ImportedVfx.HandPicked (never delete). tools/gen_auras.py turns this file into src/shared/Config/Auras.luau (who wears what) and work/auras/build.luau (run in Studio edit mode: converts each source to our R15 heroes into ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Auras.<Key>). To give a hero another aura: change or add its line in 'heroes', run tools/gen_auras.py, done (no Studio step unless a NEW key is added to 'templates').",
 "tiers": {
  "_note": "cap = estimated live particles of ONE aura (Rate x Lifetime summed), lowered by scaling rates; size = the largest particle (studs), reach = the furthest piece from the root (studs): pedestals stand 8 studs apart, so bigger pieces are shrunk/pulled in",
