 "hot": {
  "_note": "Auras that WASH OUT at maximum graphics (the hero turns into a white ball, or drowns in black smoke): hero id -> the share of its emitter rates the aura may be DRAWN at. Roblox draws about 0.4 of a rate in Studio's edit view (where the owner approved every aura) and all of it at maximum graphics, plus bloom; the game thins a hot aura on high graphics only, down to this mark (src/shared/Core/AuraDensity.luau, Fx/Vfx). 0.4 = exactly the density that was approved. Found and checked with tools/aura_judge.py (heroes on a real base at maximum graphics). Heroes sharing a template share the lowest mark. Audit of 2026-11-26: all 130 auras looked at; these seven are the ones thinning visibly helps. White-clothed heroes (Gin, Jiren, Jiraiya ...) glare at maximum graphics with NO aura at all: that is the map's bloom on white cloth, not their aura, so they carry no mark.",
  "limitless_teacher": 0.4,
  "lightning_duelist": 0.4,
  "clockwork_butler": 0.4,
  "panther_espada": 0.4,
